// `todo/t0873(b)` — the durable repro that item was filed WITHOUT (`repro = []`).
// `Vector[Callable].push` emits a plain `gorget_array_new` with a NULL
// `elem_drop`, so every pushed env leaks. Both closures CAPTURE, so the envs
