#[ignore = "KNOWN GAP (&-in-an-owning-position 1/7, struct ctor arg): sigil silently dropped on \
C and LLVM; ggdef rejects. Asserts the INTENDED reject; TODO.md. Un-ignore when the \
owning-position reject lands."]
